# Tone3000 integration config (see README "Tone3000 integration" epic).
# Copy to .env.local and fill in; .env.local is gitignored (matches *.local).
#
# The publishable key (t3k_pub_...) is safe for a client-side SPA - it's used
# as the OAuth client_id. The t3k_cs_... SECRET key is server-only per
# Tone3000's docs and MUST NOT be put here: this app is a pure client bundle,
# so a secret baked into it would be exposed to anyone who opens the source.
#
# Copy to .env.local:
#   VITE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=t3k_pub_your_key_here
#   VITE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:5173
#   # VITE_T3K_API_DOMAIN=https://www.tone3000.com  (default)
VITE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
VITE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:5173